{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_31DD63EE","title":"Hep is retired","entry":"Dlg_31DD63EE::entry","exit":"Dlg_31DD63EE::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_1AC850D6","articyId":"72057791606423564","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"What a lovely place this is. So many pretty flowers. So many people lying on the sand with their femoral arteries exposed.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What a lovely place this is. So many pretty flowers. So many people lying on the sand with their femoral arteries exposed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":150.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44626","byteOffset":31214800,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_282966D9","articyId":"72057791606423585","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Yes. It was a wrench to leave my garden. But the man said it would be for the best.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes. It was a wrench to leave my garden. But the man said it would be for the best.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26151","byteOffset":17774936,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_FB3E4240","articyId":"72057791606423592","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Hmm?","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hmm?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45540","byteOffset":31560584,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_ECA7FF25","articyId":"72057791606423619","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"It's funny, people do seem to drop dead right in front of me. The other day, I was having a lovely chat with a bartender until he broke his own neck.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's funny, people do seem to drop dead right in front of me. The other day, I was having a lovely chat with a bartender until he broke his own neck.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1650.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23935","byteOffset":16934840,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_537E4234","articyId":"72057791606423626","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Oh, well I'm not sure what I know, dear. So many faces. So much blood.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, well I'm not sure what I know, dear. So many faces. So much blood.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1650.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38635","byteOffset":28950456,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_A71FD687","articyId":"72057791606423640","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Why, no! Sociopathic tendencies are what made my career. I was terribly lucky to find a job that I loved. It hardly seemed like work at all.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why, no! Sociopathic tendencies are what made my career. I was terribly lucky to find a job that I loved. It hardly seemed like work at all.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2250.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26188","byteOffset":17789392,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_67857AD1","articyId":"72057791606423667","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"That's rather unkind, dear. Perhaps you should take it back.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's rather unkind, dear. Perhaps you should take it back.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23577","byteOffset":16797368,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_06BFE2F4","articyId":"72057791606423688","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"There. Now there's no need for things to get messy. I'm going to take a little rest now. Retirement is busier than I thought. Have a nice day.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There. Now there's no need for things to get messy. I'm going to take a little rest now. Retirement is busier than I thought. Have a nice day.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17144","byteOffset":14376144,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_9286EBDF","articyId":"72057791606423706","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"Well, you go ahead. But be careful on the paths when you leave. I'd hate for you to fall and impale yourself. So many accidents...","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, you go ahead. But be careful on the paths when you leave. I'd hate for you to fall and impale yourself. So many accidents...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22986","byteOffset":16580552,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_1AB41D5B","articyId":"72057791606423725","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Hepzibah Gimble","text":"And you, dearie.","speakerId":"Hepzibah_Gimble","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And you, dearie.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46930","byteOffset":32083720,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_C8954800","articyId":"72057791606423571","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What?","TextSheVersion":"What?","TextTheyVersion":"What?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":450.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51030","byteOffset":33646440,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_24FCDC3B","articyId":"72057791606423578","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm glad you're happy here.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm glad you're happy here.","TextSheVersion":"I'm glad you're happy here.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm glad you're happy here."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":450.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23261","byteOffset":16681736,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_12288BAB","articyId":"72057791606423599","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Are you still killing people?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","p